msgstr "Om du gillar vårt plugin, ge oss gärna ett"

#: backend.js:3128
msgid ""
"If you need help, please contact us via email. The information is in "
"\"Support Info\" area - button above."
msgstr ""
"Om du behöver hjälp, vänligen kontakta oss via e-post. Informationen finns i"
" området \"Supportinfo\" - knappen ovan."

#: sasoEventtickets_Options.php:338
