#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: index.php
msgid "Event Tickets with Ticket Scanner"
msgstr "Event Tickets med Ticket Scanner"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: index.php
msgid "https://vollstart.com/event-tickets-with-ticket-scanner/docs/"
msgstr "https://vollstart.com/event-tickets-with-ticket-scanner/docs/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: index.php
msgid ""
"You can create and generate tickets and codes. You can redeem the tickets at"
" entrance using the built-in ticket scanner. You customer can download a PDF"
" with the ticket information. The Premium allows you also to activate user "
"registration and more. This allows your user to register them self to a "
"ticket."
msgstr ""
"Du kan skapa och generera biljetter och koder. Du kan lösa in biljetterna "
"vid entrén med den inbyggda biljettskannern. Din kund kan ladda ner en PDF "
"med biljettinformationen. Premium låter dig också aktivera "
"användarregistrering och mer. Det låter dina användare registrera sig själva"
" till en biljett."

#. Author of the plugin
#: index.php
msgid "Vollstart"
msgstr "Vollstart"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: index.php
msgid "https://vollstart.com"
msgstr "https://vollstart.com"

